sha2 (the Meadow package) is a port of the Rust crate sha2
(https://github.com/RustCrypto/hashes), version 0.10.9, by the RustCrypto
Developers, to Meadow. Its constants and test cases are generated from that
crate, and its code is translated from the crate's portable implementation.

